DESCRIPTION:Kayaking Sonoma County & Beyond\nHello All\,\nThis is a first 
 event of its kind at Lake Sonoma.\n\n**SAVE THE DATE**\n\nIf you or your g
 uest needs a kayak / paddle / PFD they will be provided at no charge (quan
 tities are limited)\nAll equipment must be reserved ahead of time.\nCall B
 rent to reserve equipment\n707 867 8166\n\n**MORE INFORMATION TO COME**
